%section.marketing-section.marketing-section-alt
  .container
    %p.marketing-kicker Three outcomes
    %h2.h3.mb-4 What the People Team is trying to deliver ... and why the business wins

    .mb-5
      %h3.h5 Build a culture of fairness, continuous feedback, and unfading growth
      %p.text-muted.mb-2
        Fairness shouldn’t depend on who remembers what at review time. Continuous feedback and growth beyond promotions become how the company operates ... not an annual event.
      %p.small.mb-0
        = link_to "People Team →", "#people", class: "text-decoration-none"
        = succeed " · " do
          = link_to "Employees →", "#employees", class: "text-decoration-none"
        = link_to "Managers →", "#managers", class: "text-decoration-none"

    .mb-5
      %h3.h5 Add talent density ... and leading indicators ... to the scorecard
      %p.text-muted.mb-2
        When expectations are explicit and progress is visible, ambiguity stops hiding underperformance and overlooking growth. The People Team can show the exec team rising talent density through clearer leading indicators ... without speaking “to the CEO page”; the Prize sells upward from the People Team’s eyes.
      %p.small.mb-0
        = link_to "How the People Team sells this upward →", "#people", class: "text-decoration-none"

    %div
      %h3.h5 Make manager's lives easier with real data and connected systems at their fingertips
      %p.text-muted.mb-2
        Replace disconnected shout-out tools, forgotten verbal feedback, and forms nobody reopens ... with systems that put evidence, clarity, and coaching tools where work already happens.
      %p.small.mb-0
        = link_to "See the Path on Solutions →", solutions_path, class: "text-decoration-none"
